   "author": "kurt",
   "license": "CC0",
   "description": "  I found these on my computer from several years ago.\u00a0 There is some echo so I'm not sure if they are usable.\u00a0 There are multiple shots in each file.\u00a0 If anyone is able to edit them into something more useful, feel free. I don't expect any new gunshot recordings since these were not my guns. Enjoy :) \n \u00a0 \n",
